id: pm-ts-starter-hwu0
title: Regenerate the changelog after the release tag exists
description: "The daily release committed CHANGELOG.md before creating its own release tag, leaving an Unreleased heading that changelog:check rejects as soon as the tag exists. Regenerate the committed changelog with the release tag present so main and inherited pull request checks agree with deterministic output."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T14:58:16.342Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T14:58:33.223Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T14:58:30.787Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T14:58:30.787Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
resolution: "Regenerate the complete changelog only after the tracking item reaches its final state, then verify deterministic agreement."
expected_result: The committed changelog exactly matches a fresh full regeneration with the existing release tag present.
actual_result: "Before repair, changelog:check reports the file out of date and shows only the stale Unreleased heading changing to the dated 2026.8.29 release heading."
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T14:58:30.370Z",pi-agent,"Baseline evidence: npm run changelog:check exited 1 with \"Changelog is out of date\" and showed only ## Unreleased changing to ## 2026.8.29 - 2026-08-29."
  "2026-08-30T14:58:33.223Z",pi-agent,"Repair evidence: npm run changelog:full completed, and npm run changelog:check exited 0 with \"Changelog is up to date\". The generated changelog contains the current release heading and this closed tracking item under Unreleased."
files[1]{path,scope}:
  CHANGELOG.md,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "npm run changelog:check",project,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T14:58:29.945Z",local_mutation,chore/regenerate-changelog-after-release-tag
close_reason: The stale release heading is ready to regenerate after this item reaches its final closed state; final changelog verification will be recorded before commit.
body: ""
